{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15798","headline":"寄准上人 · 司空曙","name":"寄准上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨闻归旧寺，暂别欲经年。\n樵客应同步，邻僧定伴禅。\n後峯秋有雪，远涧夜鸣泉。\n偶与支公论，人间自共传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15798.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15798","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}